    "aggressive_orders": [
      "attack",
      "breakthrough"
    ],
    "rule": "Every eligible NPC-only engaged sector may resolve exact contact through battle_resolve at each shared review window. Player-controlled sectors are never auto-resolved; delayed reports and actionable crises may interrupt Wei before later chronology so he can lawfully reinforce, detach, request support, or remain committed elsewhere."
  },
